  "title": "Jamaican Beef Patties",
  "slug": "jamaican-beef-patties",
  "summary": "Jamaican beef patties are savory, flaky pastries filled with a spiced minced beef mixture. They are a popular Caribbean snack or light meal, characterized by their golden, turmeric-tinted crust and aromatic seasoning.",
